---
description: Architecture tests and evaluation fixtures
globs: ["tests/**/*.py", "evals/**", "scripts/**/*.py"]
alwaysApply: false
---

- Architecture tests enforce **repository constraints**, not missing product behavior.
- Prefer stdlib `unittest`. Do not add pytest unless an ADR says so.
- Every file in `evals/scenarios/` must be valid JSON with explicit `ground_truth`.
- Do not commit `evals/output/`.
- Do not add anomaly-detection scoring until detectors exist.
- `scripts/check_architecture.py` and `scripts/eval_smoke.py` must remain runnable with no pip install.
